<title>USA: Roy F. Weston retains Oppenheimer.</title>
<headline>Roy F. Weston retains Oppenheimer.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Pa. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roy F. Weston Inc said on Monday that it retained Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc as  its financing and strategic advisers.</p>
<p>The company said that Oppenheimer would enable the company to explore strategic growth opportunities to improve its competitive position and provide enhanced shareholder value.</p>
<p>Roy F. Weston, an international environmental services firm, plans to create a stronger and more efficient organization.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
